        "description": "Bulk operations do not accept \`permanent\`; permanently delete cards in Trash one at a time with DELETE /v1/cards/{cardId}?permanent=true.",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "description": "Up to 100 items. \`create\` items take content, url, notes, tags, cardType, pageSnapshotKey, sourceUrl and sourceTitle; \`update\` items take cardId plus content, url, notes or tags; \`favorite\` items take cardId and isFavorited. \`delete\`, \`restore\`, \`archive\` and \`unarchive\` items take cardId. \`addTags\` and \`removeTags\` items take cardId and tags (up to 20, each at most 64 characters); tags are matched ignoring case, and removeTags also clears tags Teak added. Repeating an operation on a card already in that state succeeds without changing it.",
