    "description": "Run a bulk card operation for up to 100 items. Items for favorite take { cardId, isFavorited }; delete, restore, archive and unarchive take { cardId }; addTags and removeTags take { cardId, tags }. Delete batches move cards to Trash and require confirm: true. failedIds lists the cards to retry.",
    "inputSchema": {
