    "description": "List the cards closest in meaning to one card, of any type unless type narrows them; the card itself is never listed. Ordered newest first unless sort says otherwise. Returns { items, total, pageInfo, similarity }, where total counts the items on this page; similarity is pending while the card is still being read, and unavailable for a card in Trash or not found.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
